00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:46.132
of the conference

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:47.533
where most of the conference

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:49.435
or a majority of the conference

00:07:49.435 --> 00:07:51.871
do want to actually unify, govern

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:53.539
and get some stuff done.

00:07:53.539 --> 00:07:55.041
And get some of the red meat stuff

00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:55.575
out there.

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:56.943
But I am just a

00:07:56.943 --> 00:07:58.478
when when when Jeff was talking,

00:07:58.478 --> 00:08:00.079
I was thinking about what

00:08:00.079 --> 00:08:01.481
speaker former Speaker John

00:08:01.481 --> 00:08:03.416
Boehner used to say back

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:04.317
when he was in charge.

00:08:04.317 --> 00:08:06.252
He would try to temper expectations

00:08:06.252 --> 00:08:07.920
against a Democratic Senate

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.155
and a Democratic White House

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:09.555
back, that

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:10.790
he said we control

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.157
what was at

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.259
one half of one third of government

00:08:13.559 --> 00:08:14.961
to try to illustrate

00:08:14.961 --> 00:08:15.628
how little

00:08:15.628 --> 00:08:17.163
they could actually get accomplished

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:18.998
because of the opposition in the Senate

00:08:18.998 --> 00:08:20.233
and the White House.

00:08:20.233 --> 00:08:21.000
How is Speaker

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.034
McCarthy going to temper

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:22.902
those expectations?

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:23.369
Against these?

00:08:23.369 --> 00:08:23.536
House

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:24.704
Republicans have set a pretty

00:08:24.704 --> 00:08:25.605
high bar for him.

00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:27.273
I mean, one dynamic to watch.

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:27.473
Yeah,

00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:28.007
they're not going to be

00:08:28.007 --> 00:08:30.076
unilaterally passing any spending bills

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:32.178
or dealing with the debt ceiling.

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:33.946
They have to deal with the other half of

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.748
two thirds right now, one.

